Consider the following C code segment. <pre><code>
int a, b, c = 0;
void prtFun(void);
main( )
{ static int a = 1; /* Line 1 */
   prtFun( );
   a += 1;
   prtFun( );
   printf(" \n %d %d ", a, b);
}
void prtFun(void)
{ static int a = 2; /* Line 2 */
   int b = 1;
   a += ++b;
   printf(" \n %d %d ", a, b);
}</code></pre>What output will be generated by the given code segment if: <br><br>
Line 1 is replaced by auto int a = 1; <br>
Line 2 is replaced by register int a = 2;

